  "description": "Dependency-free boolean expression optimizer: provably minimal results with explicit proof status (exact Quine-McCluskey backend), built-in CDCL SAT solver with equivalence checking and counterexamples, Tseitin CNF, ROBDD with model counting, truth tables with don't-cares, multi-output CSV minimization, and DIMACS/BLIF/Verilog exporters.",
